      "value": "Technically a version of this still rarely happens but it's fixed with an avatar hide/show. Not the same cause though.\nEither way that bug is being tracked separately elsewhere and this 2-year-old post references an issue that was fixed a while ago. Similar symptoms may appear elsewhere but the bug is either a regression or a different cause.",
